{"productId": "1dd96693-2f85-4fe0-a59e-2ba9644ea653", "modelName": "X-Bolt 2 Hells Canyon Max LR HD", "modelDescription": "The Hell\u2019s Canyon Max LR HD is designed to bridge the gap between long range hunting and precision competition. It has all of the performance-driven features made famous by the X-Bolt, all rolled into a revised action with additional bolt guidance for smoother bolt operation. The lengths of the fluted, heavy sporter contour barrels run 2\" longer than standard lengths (to a maximum of 26\") for added bullet velocity. The muzzle is belled to accommodate the larger 5/8\"-24 suppressor-ready threading. The action is bedded, and the barrel is free floated for consistent accuracy. The X-Bolt 2 Hell's Canyon Max LR HD rifle takes innovation to the next level with its stock design. Correct eye-to-scope alignment is easily achieved via the easy to use adjustable comb. Your personal length of pull is also readily dialed-in with the included spacers. A wider fore-end adds stability from the bench and is also easy to adapt to fit an ARCA/Swiss rail. A hand-applied camouflage finish uses a bronze and gray color palette to blend in to a variety of environments and enhance the visual appeal of the stock.", "manufacturerName": "Browning", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "16a098dc-7b87-41de-9b40-be43fda40c96", "description": "Browning, X-Bolt 2 Hells Canyon Max LR HD, 300 Win Mag, 26\" Threaded Barrel, Smoked Bronze Cerakote, Bronze/Gray Camo Adjustable Synthetic Stock, Right Hand, 5 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/a23121a5-7b9f-46d4-80f2-0136ebd4b5fe"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "036144229", "upc": "023614872757", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "5978af0e-1de2-4b6e-9b64-b8c25e2e8d70", "attributeName": "Caliber", "attributeValueId": "2ccacbdc-dd4c-44c0-930e-757917ba4410", "valueName": "300 Winchester Magnum"}, {"attributeNameId": "2765db68-a9f0-406d